@startuml m2-workflow1-sequence
title Workflow 1: employee reports → triage → prioritise → assign → notify
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
autonumber
actor "Employee\n(Dev)" as Dev
participant "Report page\n(React)" as UI
participant "TriageController" as TC
participant "TriageServiceImpl\n(M2)" as TS
participant "EnsembleClassifier\n(M2)" as EC
participant "DuplicateDetector\n(M2)" as DD
participant "IncidentLifecycleService\n(M1)" as LS
participant "PriorityService\n(M1)" as PS
participant "SlaService\n(M3)" as SLA
participant "AssignmentServiceImpl\n(M2)" as AS
participant "NotificationDispatcher\n(M4)" as ND

Dev -> UI : types title and details
UI -> TC : POST /api/v1/triage/preview (debounced 600 ms)
TC -> TS : analyse(title, description)
TS -> TS : embed text once (MiniLM, 384-d)
TS -> EC : classifyAll(text, vector)
EC --> TS : APPLICATION · Fee Payment App (0.99, kNN + keywords)
TS -> DD : find(vector, service, now, policy)
DD --> TS : likely duplicates (score ≥ 0.62), possibly related (≥ 0.50)
TS --> UI : suggestion, votes, duplicate bands
UI --> Dev : suggested category/service; banner if a likely duplicate exists

alt Dev clicks "Yes, join INC-1024"
  UI -> TC : POST /api/v1/triage/incidents/1024/join
  TC -> LS : IncidentCommandPort.joinAsDuplicate(1024, dev)
  note right of LS : affected users +1 → priority recalculated
else Dev submits a new report
  UI -> LS : POST /api/v1/incidents
  LS -> TS : checkNotRepeatSubmission(reporter, text)
  LS -> TS : classify(text) (or the user's choice)
  LS -> PS : assess(impact, urgency, criticality, users, blast radius)
  PS --> LS : P1 (score 83.2)
  LS -> SLA : targetsFor(service, P1)
  LS -> TS : index(incidentId, text)
  LS -> AS : autoAssign(category, service, P1)
  AS -> AS : skill → eligible (available, below max load)
  AS -> AS : active strategy ranks (SMART)
  AS --> LS : Sneha Reddy 0.715 ["APPLICATION skill", "load 1/6", "3 past fixes on Fee Payment App", ...]
  LS -> ND : events after commit (IncidentReported, IncidentAssigned)
  ND --> Dev : in-app + email acknowledgement
  note over ND : assigned technician gets push + in-app
end
@enduml
